WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:31.630 --> 01:33.550
Okay, thank you.

01:33.550 --> 01:35.820
All right, is that everybody?

01:35.820 --> 01:40.810
MY
MOTHER

01:35.820 --> 01:40.810
4rd Period

01:40.830 --> 01:40.950
HOME VISIT INFORMATION

01:43.370 --> 01:44.970
You all have an assignment due.

01:44.970 --> 01:48.420
You'll need to do a written essay
about your mother or your father.

01:49.590 --> 01:52.170
Isn't that an invasion of privacy?

01:53.250 --> 01:54.170
Kagami.

01:55.730 --> 01:56.930
Kuro-chan.

01:56.930 --> 01:58.050
But...

01:58.050 --> 01:59.890
Hokay, I see.

01:59.890 --> 02:04.180
During <i>your</i> home visit, I'll say
that you hate doing essays.

02:04.890 --> 02:05.830
Fine!

02:05.830 --> 02:09.090
Then I'll say that you're a virgin!

02:09.950 --> 02:10.990
Don't!

02:10.990 --> 02:14.280
Kuro-chan, that would be a
huge violation of his privacy.

02:25.490 --> 02:27.350
<i>Home visits.</i>

02:27.350 --> 02:29.270
<i>They are can't-miss opportunities.</i>

02:31.590 --> 02:36.550
<i>Indeed, schools and households must work together in order to raise the kids.</i>

02:36.910 --> 02:40.770
<i>And those essays their kids wrote will make terrific conversation starters.</i>

02:40.770 --> 02:43.790
<i>It'll be a friendly and barrier-free way of teaching!</i>

02:43.790 --> 02:46.060
<i>Mm-hmm! No doubt!</i>

02:49.270 --> 02:52.060
Someone should put an end to these home visits!

02:52.060 --> 02:54.530
There is simply no meaning to them.

02:54.530 --> 02:57.250
No one wants them anyway, and they are just a good bunch of trouble.

02:57.250 --> 02:59.450
Mm-hmm, you're right about that.

02:59.970 --> 03:02.680
You go to X number of houses in this hot weather.

03:02.680 --> 03:06.050
At best, you talk with them
for about fifteen minutes.

03:06.050 --> 03:10.710
Unless there are problems with the child, you just greet, chit-chat and be on your way.

03:11.030 --> 03:15.390
The parents are never going to take time off from work just to do that.

03:15.390 --> 03:17.330
Uh, pardon me...

03:17.330 --> 03:18.710
Oh, Aoki-sensei.

03:19.050 --> 03:22.730
There must be parents that are willing to take time off from work to talk with us, right?

03:23.470 --> 03:24.370
Hmph!

03:25.070 --> 03:28.360
Those same parents could just do interviews here at school.

03:28.530 --> 03:29.930
Yeah, but...

03:29.930 --> 03:32.610
Since you are new, you may not already know this.

03:32.610 --> 03:36.450
Increasingly, schools are
putting an end to home visits.

03:36.450 --> 03:38.160
<i>Is she serious?</i>

03:38.730 --> 03:44.110
But, as their teachers, we must know what their home environments are like-

03:44.110 --> 03:45.790
When that happens, what will you do?

03:46.650 --> 03:51.820
If the house is run-down, or if the household is out of order, what will you be able to do about it?

03:52.130 --> 03:53.570
Uh...

03:53.570 --> 03:56.530
What <i>will</i> you do, Aoki-sensei?

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
STUDENT'S FULL NAME

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
TATEISHI RYOUKO

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
REQUESTED TIME AND DATE

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
ADDITIONAL CORRESPONDENCE

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
DESPITE FINALLY GETTING THE CHANCE TO MEET YOU, SENSEI,

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
MY WIFE AND I ARE UNABLE TO TAKE TIME OFF FROM WORK.

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
I'M AFRAID I MUST DECLINE.

04:05.340 --> 04:05.390
PLEASE UNDERSTAND.

04:05.390 --> 04:05.430
STUDENT'S FULL NAME

04:05.390 --> 04:05.430
TATEISHI RYOUKO

04:05.390 --> 04:05.430
REQUESTED TIME AND DATE

04:05.390 --> 04:05.430
ADDITIONAL CORRESPONDENCE

04:07.600 --> 04:07.640
I'M SORRY.  MY WORK SITUATION LEAVES ME WITH NO FREE TIME.

04:07.600 --> 04:07.640
I AM GOING TO HAVE TO WITHDRAW.

04:07.640 --> 04:07.680
STUDENT'S FULL NAME

04:07.640 --> 04:07.680
TATEISHI RYOUKO

04:07.640 --> 04:07.680
REQUESTED TIME AND DATE

04:07.640 --> 04:07.680
ADDITIONAL CORRESPONDENCE

04:12.830 --> 04:14.510
Aoki-sensei?

04:14.510 --> 04:16.360
I must look like a total idiot.

04:16.770 --> 04:19.000
I was the only one excited about this.

04:19.000 --> 04:21.240
Not a lot you can do about the third grade.

04:21.240 --> 04:24.060
The class makeup didn't
change from last year either.

04:25.870 --> 04:30.310
And I really wanted to know
more about my students.

04:30.310 --> 04:34.330
If that's what you want, you can always look
through the school records from previous years.

04:35.330 --> 04:36.580
RECORDS ROOM

04:40.290 --> 04:41.840
Let's see...

04:41.840 --> 04:46.090
OFFICIAL LOG

04:41.840 --> 04:46.090
A

04:42.270 --> 04:45.430
So these are the records from when they were in first grade, huh?

04:45.430 --> 04:46.090
Oh.

04:46.090 --> 04:47.610
Kokonoe?

04:47.610 --> 04:50.270
Hah, she sure looked hoity-toity.

04:50.270 --> 04:54.050
Oh, Usa was already tall for her age back then.

04:54.050 --> 04:56.560
Heh, Kagami hasn't changed a bit.

04:59.860 --> 04:59.900
HISTORY OF CHRONIC ILLNESSES, ETC.

04:59.860 --> 04:59.900
NOTHING IN PARTICULAR

05:00.020 --> 05:00.070
NOTES

05:00.020 --> 05:00.070
MOTHER PASSED AWAY, FATHER LIVING SEPARATELY
PRESENTLY IN CUSTODY OF RELATIVES

05:08.780 --> 05:10.610
You all have an assignment due.

05:10.610 --> 05:14.160
You'll need to do a written essay
about your mother or your father.

05:25.170 --> 05:28.640
MY MOTHER

05:25.170 --> 05:28.640
CLASS 3-1 KOKONOE

05:30.610 --> 05:31.570
Rin.

05:32.690 --> 05:34.060
I'm just about finished making dinner.

05:34.060 --> 05:36.230
Time to wash your hands.

05:36.230 --> 05:37.350
Okay!

05:45.070 --> 05:45.110
MY MOTHER

05:49.810 --> 05:52.330
Hey... Hey Reiji!

05:53.910 --> 05:56.170
Oh, something wrong?

06:01.650 --> 06:02.900
Sensei, good morning!

06:02.900 --> 06:04.420
Yes, good morning!

06:04.420 --> 06:05.730
Sensei!

06:07.590 --> 06:09.050
I did my homework!

06:11.550 --> 06:12.810
Me too!

06:12.810 --> 06:15.690
I wrote three pages and five lines!

06:15.690 --> 06:17.530
Uh... good!

06:20.090 --> 06:23.540
<i>"My Mother."  By Kokonoe Rin.</i>

06:24.210 --> 06:28.600
<i>My mother fixes my hair every morning.</i>

06:29.330 --> 06:34.000
<i>The hair beads that my mother gave me for my birthday are my most favorite things.</i>

06:35.610 --> 06:42.000
<i>I really love how my mother combs my hair for me.</i>

06:46.200 --> 06:48.310
<i>What should I do?</i>

06:48.310 --> 06:51.260
<i>I did something terrible to
her without even knowing.</i>

06:51.260 --> 06:54.430
Let's have sex, Sensei!

06:54.430 --> 06:59.690
<i>It said she's living with relatives.  What kind of life is that for her?</i>

06:59.690 --> 07:02.350
Sensei, I love you!

07:03.230 --> 07:09.570
<i>If she was acting out all those times because she was starving for parental love and affection...</i>

07:09.570 --> 07:11.230
Sensei!

07:15.330 --> 07:17.230
You were right here all along!

07:17.230 --> 07:18.330
Uh, well...

07:18.330 --> 07:21.730
I want to practice my horizontal bar routine.

07:22.350 --> 07:24.080
Wanna come along?

07:26.970 --> 07:28.460
Sure, I'd love to.

07:29.050 --> 07:30.340
For real?

07:41.570 --> 07:42.730
I did it!

07:42.730 --> 07:44.100
Oh, you're very good!

07:58.510 --> 08:00.410
It shouldn't hurt anymore.

08:02.450 --> 08:06.570
Somehow... you're way nicer today.

08:06.570 --> 08:07.790
Is something wrong?

08:08.420 --> 08:13.770
You got it all wrong! I'm always this nice!

08:19.530 --> 08:22.110
<i>Did that come out too forced?</i>

08:22.110 --> 08:24.550
Hold me till we get to the classroom.

08:37.070 --> 08:40.030
Where did Rin-chan run off to?

08:40.030 --> 08:42.580
Break time is just about to end-

08:44.670 --> 08:45.880
Mimi-chan?

08:45.880 --> 08:47.650
G-Guess who?

08:47.650 --> 08:49.490
For the love of - Mimi-chan!

08:52.490 --> 08:55.070
Sensei, then after that-

08:55.070 --> 08:56.470
He's carrying her!

08:56.470 --> 08:58.220
Just like a little <i>baby</i>!

09:01.650 --> 09:02.730
Kokonoe!

09:05.150 --> 09:11.230
<i>It's indisputable that teachers are suppose to treat all students equally. I get that.</i>

09:11.970 --> 09:12.990
<i>But still...</i>

09:14.730 --> 09:17.170
Tomorrow we're opening up the pool!

09:19.030 --> 09:22.830
What's with you? You've been grinning ever since we came back.

09:24.810 --> 09:27.510
These are important info for our swimming lessons.

09:27.510 --> 09:30.430
Everyone, make sure to give these to your folks.

09:30.430 --> 09:32.590
Okay!

09:32.590 --> 09:34.690
Here, pass these behind you.

09:34.690 --> 09:36.110
All right.

09:36.110 --> 09:36.630
Here.

09:36.630 --> 09:38.630
Yes, you too Kokonoe.

09:38.630 --> 09:39.890
Yup!

09:39.890 --> 09:42.140
Be sure to give this to your relative-

09:43.140 --> 09:44.270
Oh cra-

09:47.770 --> 09:50.290
<i>That's an invasion of privacy!</i>

09:50.290 --> 09:53.530
<i>Kagami, knew all along? That's why she...</i>

09:58.230 --> 10:02.280
<i>My mother fixes my hair every morning.</i>

10:02.830 --> 10:07.290
<i>I really love how my mother combs my hair for me.</i>

10:09.050 --> 10:12.390
<i>She didn't want me to know.</i>

10:22.990 --> 10:24.610
Jump!

10:27.310 --> 10:28.850
Synchro!

10:33.750 --> 10:35.290
<i>Inugami-ke!</i>

10:58.930 --> 10:59.930
Kokonoe.

11:01.950 --> 11:03.010
I'm sorry.

11:06.690 --> 11:08.370
Sensei.

11:08.370 --> 11:10.310
Are you pitying me?

11:11.810 --> 11:14.150
Were you kind to me out of sympathy?

11:14.150 --> 11:15.410
You're wrong!

11:16.110 --> 11:20.450
I mean... there might be some truth to that.

11:28.690 --> 11:29.450
Kokonoe!

11:29.990 --> 11:32.830
And I was so happy... stupid me.

11:33.730 --> 11:34.590
Wait-

11:37.340 --> 11:38.210
Koko-

11:46.140 --> 11:47.350
Dammit!

11:52.850 --> 11:56.030
<i>What have I... what have I done?</i>

11:57.410 --> 11:58.710
<i>Kokonoe...</i>

12:11.190 --> 12:17.810
<i>Kokonoe, who used to be so clingy,
now won't even look me in the eyes.</i>

12:18.790 --> 12:21.350
<i>I want to make an earnest apology.</i>

12:22.190 --> 12:28.680
<i>But what I did to Kokonoe left a deep wound.</i>

12:29.950 --> 12:32.710
<i>How can I best deal with this?</i>

12:33.690 --> 12:35.270
Let's go!

12:34.870 --> 12:35.600
Wait up!

12:35.270 --> 12:39.190
Your gym clothes are really baggy, Kuro-chan.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.500
Oh.

12:40.500 --> 12:43.330
I bought this over-sized when I was in first grade.

12:43.330 --> 12:45.200
I thought I'd grow into it.

12:45.200 --> 12:48.490
Looks like you haven't grown an inch.

12:48.490 --> 12:50.200
Fine with me.

12:50.590 --> 12:54.040
Dresses look better on you if you have a body like a doll.

12:54.040 --> 12:55.710
Lucky...

12:57.210 --> 13:00.590
Well, I wanna get big just like Mimi-chan!

13:01.040 --> 13:03.290
Well ex-cuuuse me!

13:03.290 --> 13:05.660
Ding-dong!

13:05.660 --> 13:07.580
Whaddya just make me do?

13:08.380 --> 13:11.740
Come back here! I'll show you "ding-dong", you ding-dong!

13:11.740 --> 13:12.600
Gather round!

13:18.130 --> 13:20.360
Come on, get in line Kokonoe-

13:25.210 --> 13:26.700
Serves you right.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.910
Here we go!

13:35.410 --> 13:38.420
What's with you, Rin-chan?

13:41.460 --> 13:44.050
I thought you said you could handle it!

13:50.930 --> 13:53.700
Sensei, goodbye!

13:53.700 --> 13:56.440
Everyone, goodbye!

13:59.270 --> 14:01.170
I'm gonna use the restroom.

14:01.170 --> 14:02.230
We'll be waiting!

14:03.970 --> 14:07.320
Usa, Kagami... can I have a moment?

14:08.370 --> 14:10.670
T'whaaaaat?!!

14:10.670 --> 14:14.200
Why should <i>we</i> have to help <i>you</i> out?!

14:14.200 --> 14:16.550
Just who do you think you are, virgin and all?!

14:16.550 --> 14:18.460
Kuro-chan, calm down!

14:19.110 --> 14:22.070
I told you, I want to apologize to her! But she-

14:22.070 --> 14:23.210
You're the one who screwed up, aren't you!

14:23.210 --> 14:26.710
There's <i>noooo</i> way I'd ever give you advice!

14:26.710 --> 14:29.240
It's not for me! It's for Kokonoe's sake!

14:32.230 --> 14:34.550
Aren't you the arrogant S.O.B.?

14:35.870 --> 14:37.980
That's certainly true.

14:38.690 --> 14:42.980
But I still done something really awful to Kokonoe.

14:45.430 --> 14:47.550
Aoki-sensei...

14:50.510 --> 14:55.400
Rin-chan wasn't hurt because you
announced that she had no parents.

14:55.400 --> 14:57.280
Then why?

14:59.070 --> 15:00.490
It's because...

15:01.290 --> 15:06.960
Rin-chan has... fallen head-over-heels in love with you.

15:07.370 --> 15:11.130
Th... Think about that your own damn self!

15:11.130 --> 15:13.350
Ka-Kagami, hey!

15:15.730 --> 15:17.020
Uncut virgin!

15:17.430 --> 15:19.310
H-Hey!!

15:19.670 --> 15:25.190
<i>I was right there with her, way
before he ever showed up!</i>

15:26.030 --> 15:26.940
Rin-chan!

15:34.470 --> 15:36.910
Rin-chan! Rin-chan!

15:39.630 --> 15:41.330
Ah, Kuro-chan!

15:47.090 --> 15:48.870
Where did you go off to?

15:52.510 --> 15:53.350
What's wrong?

15:54.130 --> 15:58.060
Don't take off by yourself, you idiot!

15:59.290 --> 16:02.830
But you and Mimi-chan were the ones who took off...

16:05.730 --> 16:10.070
<i>Kokonoe wasn't hurt because she had no parents?</i>

16:10.070 --> 16:11.850
<i>Then, why?</i>

16:23.100 --> 16:24.580
KOKONOE

16:32.980 --> 16:34.170
Yes?

16:37.330 --> 16:40.490
F-Forgive me... for being abrupt.

16:40.490 --> 16:44.540
I am the teacher of Class 3-1
at Futatsubashi Elementary.

16:44.540 --> 16:46.210
My name is Aoki.

16:48.120 --> 16:50.030
So it's you.

16:50.590 --> 16:54.150
I've already explained why I must decline a home visit, have I not?

16:54.150 --> 16:57.280
Um, yeah. I was just passing by on a whim.

16:57.790 --> 17:00.290
I was hoping to meet you this one time.

17:01.430 --> 17:03.280
Is that so?

17:04.790 --> 17:07.790
Rin is out right now. This way.

17:13.490 --> 17:15.350
<i>This place sure smells nice.</i>

17:16.510 --> 17:19.890
<i>Everything is in order, and it's inviting.</i>

17:20.730 --> 17:21.970
If you please.

17:21.970 --> 17:24.250
Oh, thank you very much.

17:27.170 --> 17:32.430
Er... um... are your parents here with you today?

17:32.430 --> 17:33.650
No they are not.

17:33.650 --> 17:37.590
If you wish to talk about Rin,
you may speak with me.

17:37.590 --> 17:38.660
Of course.

17:40.610 --> 17:45.660
I have learned that Rin-chan's mother has passed away and that she is now a ward of this house.

17:47.550 --> 17:52.530
This may be rude, but as her teacher I
wish to ascertain her living conditions.

17:52.530 --> 17:55.670
If you may, I would like to know
more about her background.

17:58.070 --> 18:02.650
The fact is, Rin used to live with her mother in this house, just the two of them.

18:03.410 --> 18:09.650
As for me, I am her mother's cousin whose
parents died in an accident four years ago.

18:10.390 --> 18:15.690
When she was still alive, she took
custody of me while I was still a minor.

18:17.330 --> 18:19.990
So Kokonoe is not a ward after all?

18:19.990 --> 18:20.700
Correct.

18:20.700 --> 18:24.190
Then the people now living in this house...

18:24.190 --> 18:26.830
It is just Rin and I, the both of us.

18:29.010 --> 18:32.210
<i>Kokonoe is living alone with this young man?</i>

18:33.930 --> 18:38.220
You've been doting upon Rin a lot lately.

18:38.220 --> 18:42.570
As her guardian, I should be concerned.

18:44.230 --> 18:47.410
As her teacher, you better watch your step.

18:50.780 --> 18:52.770
And what is that supposed to mean?

18:52.770 --> 18:54.860
I'm back!

18:54.860 --> 18:57.550
Reiji, the eggs were all sold out-

18:58.210 --> 18:59.360
What are <i>you</i> doing here?!

18:59.790 --> 19:02.060
Rin, that's very rude.

19:03.130 --> 19:04.370
But he's...

19:06.910 --> 19:09.000
You didn't talk about anything weird, did you?

19:10.000 --> 19:13.050
Do you know things you
don't want us to discuss about?

19:13.050 --> 19:15.500
I-I didn't mean it like that.

19:15.500 --> 19:16.590
Really?

19:16.590 --> 19:19.010
Ugh, you're mean!

19:21.510 --> 19:24.430
Hey, be a good girl and face your teacher.

19:24.430 --> 19:26.410
I don't wanna!

19:30.030 --> 19:31.520
I thank you for your time.

19:31.850 --> 19:35.270
All right, Kokonoe. I'll be seeing you tomorrow.

19:36.490 --> 19:37.910
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

19:47.830 --> 19:52.290
<i>Kokonoe's home is far more pleasant than I imagined. </i>

19:52.290 --> 19:54.730
<i>She's not going through a hard
time despite having no parents.</i>

19:56.250 --> 19:58.800
<i>I should be happy for her.</i>

19:58.800 --> 20:01.370
<i>So what is this feeling I can't shake?</i>

20:02.010 --> 20:06.190
Hey Reiji, what do you think of Sensei?

20:06.190 --> 20:10.830
Well, it's just like you said.
He seems to be really fond of you.

20:10.830 --> 20:11.890
Really?

20:12.250 --> 20:13.000
Uh-huh.

20:13.000 --> 20:16.790
If not, he wouldn't have gone
out of his way to come here.

20:20.850 --> 20:22.790
All right, let's have dinner.

20:22.790 --> 20:24.130
Okay!

20:39.170 --> 20:41.190
Are you stupid?

20:41.190 --> 20:43.170
Why did you come to my house?

20:43.710 --> 20:47.510
Is it so bad for a teacher to be
concerned about his student?

20:47.510 --> 20:50.520
You're concerned about me? Why's that?

20:50.990 --> 20:53.520
Because you're very important to me.

20:56.330 --> 20:58.020
Really?

20:58.430 --> 20:59.270
Yep!

21:00.790 --> 21:03.650
If you betray me, I'll never forgive you!

21:31.170 --> 21:36.310
<i>That was... my very first kiss.</i>

21:37.610 --> 21:40.490
<i>Why that...</i>

21:40.490 --> 21:43.310
<i>...impudent brat!</i>

21:47.860 --> 21:49.940
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.520
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.950
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.950 --> 21:56.570
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.950 --> 22:05.520
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.520 --> 22:08.070
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.980
